diff --git a/gcc/ada/ChangeLog b/gcc/ada/ChangeLog
index 23b5fbb52c43..0b66362476f5 100644
--- a/gcc/ada/ChangeLog
+++ b/gcc/ada/ChangeLog
@@ -1,3 +1,30 @@
+2026-10-07  Hodong Kim  <hodong@nimfsoft.com>
+
+	PR ada/127759
+	* libgnat/g-socthi.adb (C_Accept): Do not call Disable_SIGPIPE
+	on failure.
+	(C_Socket): Likewise.
+
+2026-10-07  Eric Botcazou  <ebotcazou@adacore.com>
+
+	PR ada/126448
+	* sem_ch8.adb (Analyze_Subprogram_Renaming): Pass Nam instead of
+	Name (N) in the calls to Find_Renamed_Entity.  Remove if_statement
+	whose condition is always false.
+	(Find_Renamed_Entity): In the overloaded case and if the overload
+	resolution has succeeded, call Mark_Use_Clauses on the entity.
+
+2026-10-07  Eric Botcazou  <ebotcazou@adacore.com>
+
+	PR ada/126125
+	* sem_ch8.adb (Find_Direct_Name): Add missing guard to the manual
+	walk of the scope stack used to cope with the Rtsfind mechanism.
+
+2026-10-07  Eric Botcazou  <ebotcazou@adacore.com>
+
+	PR ada/127756
+	* exp_util.adb (Find_Protection_Type): Remove early return.
+
 2026-09-29  Yang Yujie  <yangyujie@loongson.cn>
 
 	* libgnat/s-objrea.ads (Object_Arch): Add LOONGARCH.
